  <section><title>Activity </title>
<para>For each equation, find its solution or solutions. Be prepared to explain your reasoning.</para>
<para>For questions 1–3, review the process of solving equations.</para>
<!--Text Entry Interaction Start -->
<exercise><exercise>
  <div class="os-raise-ib-input-ack">
    <para>Compare your answer:</para>
    <para> \(x=3\)</para>
  </div>
<problem>
    <list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
      <item>\(x−3=0\)</item>
    </list>
  </problem><solution>
    <para>Enter the solution or solutions for the equation.</para>
  </solution></exercise>
</exercise><!--Interaction End -->
<br/>
<!--Text Entry Interaction Start -->
<exercise><exercise>
  <div class="os-raise-ib-input-ack">
